The text below is about the account payable process. It starts with filing a copy for internal records. 
When filing a copy for internal records is completed, creating a receiving report should be done. 
After creating a receiving report, you need to gather the vendors invoice.
After gathering the vendors invoice, the process is split into 3 parallel branches: entering the invoice into the accounts payable account, creating voucher for the documents and checking dates to avoid penalty charges. 
The process is now completed. 
